{"seq":1,"slug":"query-demand-supply-match","title":"Query 需求与商品供给匹配度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/query-log-analytics-insight/query-supply-gap/query-demand-supply-match","wordCount":3292,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"query-需求与商品供给匹配度\">Query 需求与商品供给匹配度</h1><p>前面几章一直在处理「用户想要什么」——聚类出主题、量出意图分布、还原会话路径。但从「用户想要」到「用户买到」之间横着一道鸿沟：想要的东西<strong>有没有货</strong>。同一个需求，如果站内有充足且合适的商品供给，它就是一次健康交易；如果站内没有或很少，它就是一次白白的流量浪费，而且用户在几次失败搜索后会流失到竞品。把需求侧与供给侧放到同一张表里对齐，量化每一个主题的「供给满足程度」，是本章的核心工作。</p>\n<p>这件事的难点不在于计算匹配度——那只是一次 join 加一次比值——而在于<strong>匹配口径的定义</strong>。什么叫「有供给」？只要有一个商品就算？要有足够多的商品？还是要商品本身也符合这个需求（价格、规格、款式都对）？三种口径给出的匹配度可能差十倍，而它们指向完全不同的行动。所以本章会花相当大的篇幅在口径上，因为口径错了，后面的量化再精确也是精确定义了一个错误。</p>\n<p>需要划清边界：本章讨论的匹配度是<strong>离线分析指标</strong>，用于发现缺口、驱动选品与招商决策。它不涉及在线检索的相关性判定与召回算法——那些属于在线查询理解与排序服务的范畴。我们消费它们产生的行为数据（曝光、点击、成交），从行为反推供给质量，而不是去改它们的算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"匹配对象是稀疏的多对多矩阵\">匹配对象是稀疏的多对多矩阵</h3><p>需求侧的关键词（主题）与供给侧的条目（商品、SKU）之间是一种<strong>多对多</strong>关系：一个主题对应无数商品，一个商品也满足多个主题。因此匹配分析的对象不是「主题」也不是「商品」，而是<strong>主题×商品的匹配矩阵</strong>，只不过这个矩阵极端稀疏，实际实现上从不真的建矩阵，而是通过一个可检索的中间层（商品索引或商品属性表）来近似计算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[需求侧&lt;br/&gt;主题表 + 量级] --&gt; C[匹配计算]&#10;    B[供给侧&lt;br/&gt;商品表 + 属性/类目] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D{匹配层}&#10;    D --&gt; E[检索式匹配&lt;br/&gt;主题代表词搜商品索引]&#10;    D --&gt; F[属性式匹配&lt;br/&gt;类目+规格字段对齐]&#10;    D --&gt; G[行为式匹配&lt;br/&gt;曝光/点击/成交反推]&#10;    E --&gt; H[供给覆盖度]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[匹配度分层&lt;br/&gt;充足/勉强/缺口]&#10;    I --&gt; J[缺口输出]\">graph TD\n    A[需求侧&lt;br/&gt;主题表 + 量级] --&gt; C[匹配计算]\n    B[供给侧&lt;br/&gt;商品表 + 属性/类目] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D{匹配层}\n    D --&gt; E[检索式匹配&lt;br/&gt;主题代表词搜商品索引]\n    D --&gt; F[属性式匹配&lt;br/&gt;类目+规格字段对齐]\n    D --&gt; G[行为式匹配&lt;br/&gt;曝光/点击/成交反推]\n    E --&gt; H[供给覆盖度]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[匹配度分层&lt;br/&gt;充足/勉强/缺口]\n    I --&gt; J[缺口输出]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>匹配口径</th>\n<th>判定方式</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存在性</td>\n<td>主题下至少 1 个商品</td>\n<td>实现最简</td>\n<td>把「有个勉强相关的」当成有供给</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丰富度</td>\n<td>主题下商品数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>抗单点</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 取值武断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量加权</td>\n<td>商品数按相关性/评分加权</td>\n<td>更接近真实满足度</td>\n<td>权重难标定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为反推</td>\n<td>曝光/点击/成交率</td>\n<td>反映真实体验</td>\n<td>冷启动主题无行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合口径</td>\n<td>丰富度门槛 + 行为兜底</td>\n<td>兼顾覆盖与体验</td>\n<td>实现复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"需求侧与供给侧的表示\">需求侧与供给侧的表示</h2><h3 id=\"需求侧-主题表加量级\">需求侧：主题表加量级</h3><p>需求侧的表示在这一步已经准备好：主题表（来自 <a href=\"../query-clustering/query-similarity-cluster\">Query 相似度聚类与主题发现</a>）加上量级（来自 <a href=\"../intent-distribution/long-tail-head-analysis\">头部 vs 长尾 query 分析</a>）。每个主题带着它的代表 query、请求量、以及已观测到的行为指标（点击率、转化率、零结果率）。关键点是主题必须<strong>先归一化</strong>（<a href=\"../query-clustering/query-normalize-merge\">等价/同义 query 归一聚合</a>），否则同一需求被拆成几条，每条看起来供给都不足，实际上合起来是够的。</p>\n<p>供给侧则要求把商品表示成<strong>可被需求语言检索到的形式</strong>。这里的核心张力是：商品的官方描述（标题、类目、属性）和用户的搜索语言往往不一致。一件商品标题写「轻薄透气运动鞋男夏季新款」，用户搜的是「夏天穿不闷脚的球鞋」——用文本匹配对不上，但它们其实是同一件东西。三个可行的对齐手段：</p>\n<p><strong>属性结构化</strong>：把商品的关键属性（类目、品牌、规格、适用场景、风格）抽成结构化字段，匹配时用属性而非自由文本。这依赖商品数据的质量，也是商品数据治理（58 系列的目录数据治理）的产出。</p>\n<p><strong>查询-商品向量对齐</strong>：把主题代表 query 与商品标题都编码成向量，用向量近邻找候选。这条路径能跨越词汇差异，但需要商品向量索引，且对规格类匹配（<code>40码</code>）不敏感——向量模型常常分不清尺寸数字，所以必须与结构化属性匹配组合使用。</p>\n<p><strong>行为反推</strong>：用真实用户的行为做最终的裁判。如果某主题下用户点击了大量商品、却很少成交，说明商品「看起来对、实际不对」。</p>\n<p>实务中三者叠加：属性做硬过滤（类目、规格），向量做候选召回，行为做质量加权。</p>\n<h3 id=\"供给侧对齐的三种手段\">供给侧对齐的三种手段</h3><p>三个可行的对齐手段对应不同的成本与覆盖：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>需要什么</th>\n<th>擅长</th>\n<th>盲区</th>\n<th>典型实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>属性结构化</td>\n<td>商品属性字段完整</td>\n<td>规格、类目硬过滤</td>\n<td>属性缺失的商品被漏掉</td>\n<td>类目树 + 规格词表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询-商品向量</td>\n<td>商品向量索引</td>\n<td>跨词汇同义</td>\n<td>数字规格（<code>40码</code>）分不清</td>\n<td>双塔编码 + HNSW 近邻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为反推</td>\n<td>曝光/点击/成交明细</td>\n<td>反映真实满足度</td>\n<td>冷启动主题无行为</td>\n<td>贝叶斯平滑的 CTR 估计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"匹配度的量化\">匹配度的量化</h2><h3 id=\"供需比与它的两个陷阱\">供需比与它的两个陷阱</h3><p>匹配度不能只有「有/无」两态，要给出分层的强度。一个可操作的量化是<strong>供需比</strong>：主题 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的供给强度除以它的需求强度。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SupplyRatio}(t) = \\frac{\\mathrm{effective\\_items}(t)}{\\mathrm{demand}(t)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SupplyRatio</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.386em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">demand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">effective_items</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>effective_items</code> 是主题下的有效商品数（经质量过滤，剔除下架、违规、严重不符的），<code>demand</code> 是主题的请求量（通常取日均）。比值高说明供给充裕，比值低说明供给紧张。但直接用这个比值排序会踩坑：分母为极大值（头部主题）时比值天然小，看上去到处是缺口；分母极小时（长尾主题）比值又可能虚高。所以比值必须配合<strong>绝对量级门槛</strong>一起用——只有需求达到一定规模的缺口才值得行动。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三维打分与分档\">三维打分与分档</h3><p>更稳健的方案是<strong>三维打分</strong>：覆盖度（供给是否存在）、丰度（供给是否够多够分散）、适配度（供给是否真的对上需求，用行为衡量）。三维各自归一化后加权得到综合匹配分，再按分数分档：充足 / 勉强 / 缺口 / 空白。</p>\n<p>覆盖度用存在性判定（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>effective_items</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c = \\mathbb{1}[\\text{effective\\_items} &gt; 0]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">effective_items</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>），丰度按商品数取对数后归一（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mtext>items</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a = \\frac{\\log(1 + \\text{items})}{\\log(1 + N_{\\max})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">l</span><span class=\"mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">l</span><span class=\"mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">items</span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，对数是为了不让头部主题的万级商品把量纲拉爆），适配度用行为指标经过贝叶斯平滑后的水平（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>clicks</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mtext>impressions</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{p} = \\frac{\\text{clicks} + \\alpha \\bar{p}}{\\text{impressions} + \\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4133em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">impressions</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">clicks</span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 取几十量级、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7622em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为先验均值，避免曝光极少时点击率虚高）。三者加权即得综合分。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>覆盖度</th>\n<th>丰度</th>\n<th>适配度</th>\n<th>建议动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>充足</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>维持，优化 ranking</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>勉强</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>扩充同类供给</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺口</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>商品质量或选品问题，见 <a href=\"query-gap-merchant\">供给缺口输出</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空白</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>未满足需求，见 <a href=\"unmet-demand-discover\">未满足需求发现</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个分档表是本章与后续两节的分界线：「空白」档直接进入未满足需求发现（选品输入），「缺口」档进入供给缺口输出（商家/采购），「勉强」档是运营可自行优化的部分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"匹配计算的聚合-sql\">匹配计算的聚合 SQL</h3><p>把三维打分写成一次聚合查询，输入是主题量级表与商品匹配结果表（<code>topic_demand</code> 与 <code>topic_item</code>）。用 CTE 分步算出三个维度，再做加权与分档：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH supply AS (&#10;  SELECT topic_id,&#10;         COUNT(DISTINCT item_id)                                  AS effective_items,&#10;         LOG(1 + COUNT(DISTINCT item_id))                         AS abundance_raw&#10;  FROM topic_item&#10;  WHERE item_status = &#39;on_sale&#39;          -- 剔除下架/违规&#10;  GROUP BY topic_id&#10;),&#10;behav AS (&#10;  SELECT topic_id,&#10;         SUM(impression_cnt) AS imp, SUM(click_cnt) AS clk, SUM(order_cnt) AS ord,&#10;         -- 适配度：贝叶斯平滑后的转化率，alpha 为先验强度&#10;         (SUM(order_cnt) + :alpha * :prior_cvr) / (SUM(click_cnt) + :alpha) AS cvr_smooth&#10;  FROM topic_behavior&#10;  GROUP BY topic_id&#10;),&#10;joined AS (&#10;  SELECT d.topic_id, d.daily_req,&#10;         COALESCE(s.effective_items, 0)                    AS items,&#10;         COALESCE(s.abundance_raw, 0) / :log_items_cap     AS abundance,&#10;         COALESCE(b.cvr_smooth, 0)                         AS fit,&#10;         CASE WHEN COALESCE(s.effective_items,0) &gt; 0&#10;              THEN 1 ELSE 0 END                            AS coverage,&#10;         -- 供需比：商品数 / 日均请求，仅用于参考，排序须配合量级门槛&#10;         CASE WHEN d.daily_req &gt; 0&#10;              THEN COALESCE(s.effective_items,0) / d.daily_req END AS supply_ratio&#10;  FROM topic_demand d&#10;  LEFT JOIN supply s USING (topic_id)&#10;  LEFT JOIN behav  b USING (topic_id)&#10;)&#10;scored AS (&#10;  SELECT *,&#10;         (:w_c * coverage + :w_a * abundance + :w_f * fit)  AS match_score&#10;  FROM joined&#10;  WHERE daily_req &gt;= :min_demand        -- 绝对量级门槛，挡掉长尾虚高&#10;)&#10;SELECT topic_id, daily_req, items, coverage, abundance, fit, supply_ratio, match_score,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN coverage = 0        THEN &#39;blank&#39;&#10;         WHEN match_score &lt; :gap_line THEN &#39;gap&#39;&#10;         WHEN match_score &lt; :ok_line  THEN &#39;marginal&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;sufficient&#39;&#10;       END                                                  AS tier&#10;FROM scored&#10;ORDER BY daily_req * (1.0 - match_score) DESC;   -- 优先级 = 需求规模 × 缺口严重度\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supply </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> topic_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_id)                                  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> effective_items,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         LOG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_id))                         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> abundance_raw</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> topic_item</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'on_sale'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          -- 剔除下架/违规</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> topic_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">behav </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> topic_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(impression_cnt) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> imp, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(click_cnt) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clk, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_cnt) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ord,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         -- 适配度：贝叶斯平滑后的转化率，alpha 为先验强度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_cnt) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :prior_cvr) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(click_cnt) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :alpha) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cvr_smooth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> topic_behavior</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> topic_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">joined </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">topic_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">daily_req</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">abundance_raw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :log_items_cap     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> abundance,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cvr_smooth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fit,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                            AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coverage,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         -- 供需比：商品数 / 日均请求，仅用于参考，排序须配合量级门槛</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">daily_req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">daily_req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supply_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> topic_demand d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supply s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (topic_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> behav  b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (topic_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scored </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         (:w_c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coverage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :w_a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> abundance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :w_f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fit)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> match_score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> joined</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_req </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :min_demand        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 绝对量级门槛，挡掉长尾虚高</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> topic_id, daily_req, items, coverage, abundance, fit, supply_ratio, match_score,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coverage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'blank'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> match_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :gap_line </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'gap'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> match_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :ok_line  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'marginal'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sufficient'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                                  AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scored</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_req </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> match_score) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 优先级 = 需求规模 × 缺口严重度</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ORDER BY</code> 这一行就是本章强调的优先级口径：<strong>需求规模 × 缺口严重度</strong>，而不是只按缺口严重度排。<code>LEFT JOIN</code> 而非 <code>INNER JOIN</code> 是另一处关键：真正零供给的主题在 <code>topic_item</code> 里根本没有行，用内连接会把它们整批丢掉——而它们恰恰是最重要的一档。<code>coverage = 0 → blank</code> 必须在 <code>COALESCE</code> 之后判定，才能让「查无此货」的主题进入选品流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行为信号-把-有货-与-好货-分开\">行为信号：把「有货」与「好货」分开</h2><h3 id=\"四类行为模式对应四种病因\">四类行为模式对应四种病因</h3><p>供给充足不等于满足需求。一个主题可能有 500 个商品，但用户点开就关、或者点遍全站也找不到想要的，那么对用户而言等于没有供给。行为信号正是用来切开这一层：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>零结果率</strong>：最硬的缺口信号，系统直接找不到东西。注意要和「零结果但用户其实是拼写错误」区分（用纠错采纳率辅助判断）。</li>\n<li><strong>低点击率 + 有零结果</strong>：有商品但都不对，用户扫一眼就放弃。</li>\n<li><strong>高点击 + 低转化</strong>：商品看起来相关、点进去发现不符（价格、规格、成色），是「适配度」问题。</li>\n<li><strong>高曝光 + 高点击 + 高转化</strong>：健康供给，无需动作。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这四类映射到上面的三维分档，就能得到有优先级排序的缺口清单。优先级用<strong>需求规模 × 缺口严重度</strong>排序，而不是单纯按缺口严重度——一个极其严重但每天只有十次请求的空白主题，优先级应当低于一个中等严重但每天十万次请求的缺口主题。</p>\n<p>行为反推有一个固有限制：<strong>冷启动</strong>。全新主题没有历史行为，无法用行为判断适配度。此时只能用属性/向量匹配做初判，并把该主题标记为「待观察」，等行为积累后再回算。这也是 <a href=\"../query-clustering/emerging-query-detect\">新兴/突增 query 发现</a> 与本章天然衔接的地方——新词一冒出来就该进匹配分析，哪怕暂时只能用不完整的方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程实现与口径治理\">工程实现与口径治理</h2><h3 id=\"周期性批作业与版本快照\">周期性批作业与版本快照</h3><p>实现上，匹配分析是一条<strong>周期性批作业</strong>：取主题表与商品表快照，做匹配计算，输出主题级评分表。频率通常周级（供给变化没快到需要天级），但在大促前需要加密。计算量的主体是匹配本身：如果主题数是一万级、商品数是亿级，逐一计算不可能的，必须借助商品索引（把主题代表词当成查询去检索商品库）或向量近邻。</p>\n<p>输出必须携带<strong>版本信息</strong>：主题版本、商品快照时间、类目树版本。任何跨期对比都要对齐这三个版本，否则「这个主题的供给变差了」的结论可能只是商品快照时点或类目调整的假象。这与前几章反复强调的版本管理是同一条纪律。</p>\n<p>口径治理是本章最容易失控的地方，因为匹配度指标会被多个团队引用，而每个人心里的口径可能不同。三条纪律：指标定义写进数据字典并带 owner；口径变更走显式流程并回算历史；报表表头标注口径版本。搜索分析系统里，「同一个指标三个团队三个数」的健康代价，往往比算法不准更高——这一点在 <a href=\"../intent-distribution/intent-category-distribution\">按意图/品类的 query 分布</a> 中已经强调过，在供需匹配这里因为涉及跨部门（搜索、供给、招商）而更加关键。</p>\n<p>隐私与合规上，匹配分析用的是<strong>聚合后的主题与商品数据</strong>，不涉及用户标识，是本 hub 中隐私风险最低的一章。唯一的注意点是商品侧可能包含商家的经营数据（销量、库存），跨部门共享时需要按商家的数据授权范围裁剪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>匹配分析把需求侧（主题+量级）与供给侧（商品+属性）对齐，量化每个主题的供给满足程度，是选品与招商的输入。</li>\n<li>真正的难点是口径定义：存在性、丰富度、质量加权、行为反推各有盲区，实务上用组合口径。</li>\n<li>供需比必须配合绝对量级门槛使用，否则头部主题会被误判为到处缺口。</li>\n<li>三维打分（覆盖度、丰度、适配度）比单指标稳健，分档后指向不同行动：空白→选品，缺口→商家，勉强→运营。</li>\n<li>行为信号用来切开「有货」与「好货」：零结果、低点击、高点击低转化分别对应不同病因。</li>\n<li>缺口优先级按「需求规模 × 缺口严重度」排序，而不是只看严重度。</li>\n<li>冷启动主题只能用属性/向量初判并标记待观察，与新兴 query 发现天然衔接。</li>\n<li>输出必须携带主题、商品快照、类目树三个版本；口径治理要靠数据字典 + owner + 显式变更流程。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>继续读 <a href=\"unmet-demand-discover\">未满足需求发现（选品输入）</a> 看「空白」档的缺口如何被进一步加工成可执行的选品建议，再读 <a href=\"query-gap-merchant\">供给缺口输出给商家/采购</a> 看「缺口」档如何跨部门流转。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Query 需求与商品供给匹配度","id":"query-需求与商品供给匹配度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"匹配对象是稀疏的多对多矩阵","id":"匹配对象是稀疏的多对多矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"需求侧与供给侧的表示","id":"需求侧与供给侧的表示"},{"level":3,"text":"需求侧：主题表加量级","id":"需求侧-主题表加量级"},{"level":3,"text":"供给侧对齐的三种手段","id":"供给侧对齐的三种手段"},{"level":2,"text":"匹配度的量化","id":"匹配度的量化"},{"level":3,"text":"供需比与它的两个陷阱","id":"供需比与它的两个陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"三维打分与分档","id":"三维打分与分档"},{"level":3,"text":"匹配计算的聚合 SQL","id":"匹配计算的聚合-sql"},{"level":2,"text":"行为信号：把「有货」与「好货」分开","id":"行为信号-把-有货-与-好货-分开"},{"level":3,"text":"四类行为模式对应四种病因","id":"四类行为模式对应四种病因"},{"level":2,"text":"工程实现与口径治理","id":"工程实现与口径治理"},{"level":3,"text":"周期性批作业与版本快照","id":"周期性批作业与版本快照"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"会话内 query 流转路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/query-log-analytics-insight/intent-distribution/session-query-flow"},"next":{"title":"未满足需求发现（选品输入）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/query-log-analytics-insight/query-supply-gap/unmet-demand-discover"}}